		{"time": "3:14", "joke": "THE WORLD REVOLVING", "NOW'S YOUR CHANCE TO BE A - Deltarune - Jevil and Spamton dance in front of the background from Spamton's shop, with the paintings of the clouds and sun replaced with the playing card suits and one of the ducks used in Jevil's carousel attack. Jevil's tail hits Spamton and the two stare each other down, followed by static and the Televisa logo, leading into the next segment."},
