 website on the @Dub_Rip account is "skrillex.com", the website of a popular Dubstep music producer. @RipDubstep only has one Tweet: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LwurK0_TMjk This video, titled "i wonder what it says????", has the full melody swap of "Meet the Flintstones" and "Mario Circuit". The video's description is "yo dis sum lore shit?? oohohohohohohohhwwwwwwowwoww" The video contains the title screen of 7 GRAND DAD with a filter while this string of numbers is shown panning from the right:  083 116 111 112 032 097 115 115 117 109 105 110 103 032 101 118 101 114 121 116 104 105 110 103 032 116 111 032 098 101 032 108 111 114 101 033    This binary translates to "Stop assuming everything to be lore" The end of the video is the word "heck" in bold red letters"}],
