		{"time": "0:39", "joke": "DnB - An animation of a light blue and a purple line flying around the screen with the IDOLM@STER logo on top"},
		{"time": "0:49", "joke": "Jazz - A blurred video of a man playing a saxophone with the IDOLM@STER logo on top."},
		{"time": "1:00", "joke": "GBA Pokémon - The first second shows a pixelated IDOLM@STER logo replacing the Pokémon logo for Pokémon Emerald. This then cuts to a blurred gameplay footage of a fight against Haruka Amami from Pokemon Grand Dad Version, a modded version of Pokémon FireRed & LeafGreen used during the Reboot ARGs. The player's Pokémon is Grand Dad, with attacks such as Fleenstones, "Bone club", "Holy Trinity" and "Revenge". A pixelated IDOLM@STER logo is put over the footage."},
		{"time": "1:12", "joke": "Howie scream -"},
		{"time": "1:13", "joke": "Classical - Adolph von Menzel's 1854 drawing of violinist Joseph Joachim and pianist Clara Schumann. This then cuts to piano sheet music of "GO MY WAY!!". The IDOLM@STER logo is now black and white"},
		{"time": "1:24", "joke": "Super Robot Wars - The IDOLM@STER logo is made in the style of the Super Robot Wars series which reads "Idolmaster: Xenoglossia". Blurred gameplay footage from one of the games is shown, with Haruka replacing one of the characters' portrait."},
		{"time": "1:35", "joke": "Classic Namco - The IDOLM@STER logo is put over a gameplay footage of Galaga."},
		{"time": "1:46", "joke": "Demoscene - The background is black with some white dots floating from the right to the left. Underneath is a checkered floor. The IDOLM@STER logo moves in from the right to the left, moving in a wave formation until it has crossed the whole screen and leaves."},
		{"time": "1:56", "joke": "mm2wood - A MIDIJam video of the song is shown, similar to mm2wood with its instruments. The title of this MIDIJam is "song_gmw.mid". There is no IDOLM@STER logo present."},
		{"time": "2:07", "joke": "Mega Man 8 - The IDOLM@STER logo is placed in front of a blank Mega Man 8 Stage select screen. The border of the IDOLM@STER logo, as well as the dot in the I, the @ and the Japanese text changes color throughout the section, creating a rainbow effect."},
		{"time": "2:18", "joke": "Keygen music - This section starts with random letter coming towards the screen in rings before an IDOLM@STER logo is shown in screen, made out of random letters and numbers. Under the logo is the phrase "GO MY WAY!!1". Square based pyramids float above the logo from left to right. A few seconds before the section ends, the IDOLM@STER logo does a 360 spin."},
		{"time": "2:30", "joke": "Kirby with Bob Dylan + "Take On Me" (Yogurt Yard - Kirby: Nightmare in Dream Land) - A pixelated IDOLM@STER logo is placed in front of a stage from Kirby: Nightmare in Dream Land with a snowy ground and snowy mountains. Kirby accelerates a Wheelie Bike from left to right and stays at the right part of the screen, riding his bike through the stage. A few seconds in, Bob Dylan appears, riding his own Wheelie Bike smoking a cigarette, riding closely behind Kirby. Kirby leaves to the right of the screen a few seconds before the section ends and Bob Dylan quickly follows."},
		{"time": "2:57", "joke": "80s Synthwave - This section starts with squares of purple and red on both the top and bottom of the screen with small blue particles floating around. The IDOLM@STER logo zooms in from the top a few seconds later which a trail of faded IDOLM@STER logo's behind it. Once in the center of the screen, a light moves across it."},
